      "text": "Sorry to intrude..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 13.5,
      "end_time": 14.7,
      "text": "...Ah, what a relief"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 15.0,
      "end_time": 18.4,
      "text": "It seems like that sound was just things being knocked over"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 21.8,
      "end_time": 23.2,
      "text": "Wow..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 23.8,
      "end_time": 27.2,
      "text": "That's... a cauldron used for alchemy"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 28.2,
      "end_time": 30.5,
      "text": "Now it really looks the part of an alchemy lab!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 31.5,
      "end_time": 34.1,
      "text": "Wow, this is amazing. It's just like how I imagined it to be..."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 34.3,
      "end_time": 35.1,
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
